    "quantization": "int4-per-row",
    "q_packed": "uint8 [vocab_size, ceil(dims/2)]; byte j of row r holds element 2j in the HIGH nibble and element 2j+1 in the LOW nibble, two's-complement signed nibbles in [-8, 7] (odd dims: trailing low nibble is padding); identical to the kotoshu-rs pack_row_int4 contract",
